The train slowly left the platform.
Our journey began.
I looked at the other passengers in the compartment.
Everyone was busy with their own things.
A small family was sitting across from me.
A young girl was looking at her older brother.
The brother was eating his own snack.
Suddenly, the girl grabbed his snack.
He got angry and pulled his own bag close.
Their mother looked at them and laughed.
After a while, the ticket checker came into our compartment.
A man on another seat suddenly panicked.
He started searching for the ticket in his own pocket.
First he checked his own shirt pocket.
The ticket was not there.
Then he opened his own bag quickly.
Finally he found his ticket.
I had a lot of fun watching all these people.
Then I looked out the window again.
